        "prob_desc_description": "Vasya has a pile, that consists of some number of stones. $$$n$$$ times he either took one stone from the pile or added one stone to the pile. The pile was non-empty before each operation of taking one stone from the pile.You are given $$$n$$$ operations which Vasya has made. Find the minimal possible number of stones that can be in the pile after making these operations.",
