        "prob_desc_time_limit": "1 second",
        "prob_desc_input_spec": "The first line contains one positive integer $$$n$$$\u00a0\u2014 the number of operations, that have been made by Vasya ($$$1 \\leq n \\leq 100$$$). The next line contains the string $$$s$$$, consisting of $$$n$$$ symbols, equal to \"-\" (without quotes) or \"+\" (without quotes). If Vasya took the stone on $$$i$$$-th operation, $$$s_i$$$ is equal to \"-\" (without quotes), if added, $$$s_i$$$ is equal to \"+\" (without quotes).",
